ꦥꦿꦺꦴꦒꦿꦩ꧀ VM100;
ꦮꦂ
  kode : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  namaFile : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  i : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  panjang : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  curToken : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  curText : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  huruf : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  kata : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  temp : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  nilai : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  nilai2 : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  hasilExpr : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  namaVar : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  varSimpan : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  procSimpan : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  funcSimpan : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  j : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  k : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  cocok : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  angkaStr : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  hasilStr : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  digit : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  sisa : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  savedI : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  savedToken : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  savedText : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  savedKode : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  savedPanjang : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  cond : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  procBody : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  procNama : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  funcNama : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  depth : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  forVar : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
  forAwal : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  forAkhir : ꦲꦁꦏ;
  forCur : ꦲꦁꦏ;

ꦥ꦳ꦸꦁꦱꦶ ApaHuruf(h : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ) : ꦲꦁꦏ;
ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
  temp := Kode(h);
  ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ temp >= 65 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
    ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ temp <= 90 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
      ApaHuruf := 1
    ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
      ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ temp >= 97 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
        ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ temp <= 122 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
          ApaHuruf := 1
        ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
          ApaHuruf := 0
      ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
        ApaHuruf := 0
  ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
    ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ temp >= 43008 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
      ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ temp <= 43135 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
        ApaHuruf := 1
      ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
        ApaHuruf := 0
    ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
      ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ temp = 95 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
        ApaHuruf := 1
      ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
        ApaHuruf := 0;
ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;

ꦥ꦳ꦸꦁꦱꦶ ApaAngka(h : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ) : ꦲꦁꦏ;
ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
  temp := Kode(h);
  ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ temp >= 48 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
    ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ temp <= 57 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
      ApaAngka := 1
    ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
      ApaAngka := 0
  ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
    ApaAngka := 0;
ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;

ꦥ꦳ꦸꦁꦱꦶ StrKeAngka(s : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ) : ꦲꦁꦏ;
ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
  nilai := 0;
  j := 1;
  ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ j <= Panjang(s) ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ
  ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
    huruf := Ambil(s, j);
    temp := Kode(huruf);
    ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ temp >= 48 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
      ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ temp <= 57 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
        nilai := nilai * 10 + temp - 48;
    j := j + 1;
  ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
  StrKeAngka := nilai;
ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;

ꦥ꦳ꦸꦁꦱꦶ AngkaKeStr(n : ꦲꦁꦏ) : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
  ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ n = 0 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
    AngkaKeStr := '0'
  ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
    ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
      hasilStr := '';
      temp := n;
      ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ temp > 0 ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ
      ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
        sisa := temp - temp / 10 * 10;
        digit := sisa + 48;
        hasilStr := Gabung(Chr(digit), hasilStr);
        temp := temp / 10;
      ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
      AngkaKeStr := hasilStr;
    ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;

ꦥꦿꦺꦴꦱꦺꦢꦸꦂ SimpanVar(n : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ; v : ꦲꦁꦏ);
ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
  angkaStr := AngkaKeStr(v);
  varSimpan := Gabung(varSimpan, n);
  varSimpan := Gabung(varSimpan, '=');
  varSimpan := Gabung(varSimpan, angkaStr);
  varSimpan := Gabung(varSimpan, ';');
ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;

ꦥ꦳ꦸꦁꦱꦶ AmbilVar(n : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ) : ꦲꦁꦏ;
ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
  hasilExpr := 0;
  j := 1;
  ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ j <= Panjang(varSimpan) ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ
  ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
    cocok := 1;
    k := 1;
    ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ k <= Panjang(n) ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ
    ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
      ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ Ambil(varSimpan, j + k - 1) <> Ambil(n, k) ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
        cocok := 0;
      k := k + 1;
    ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
    ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ cocok = 1 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
      ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ Ambil(varSimpan, j + Panjang(n)) = '=' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
      ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
        kata := '';
        k := j + Panjang(n) + 1;
        ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ k <= Panjang(varSimpan) ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ
        ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
          huruf := Ambil(varSimpan, k);
          ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ huruf = ';' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
            k := Panjang(varSimpan) + 1
          ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
            kata := Gabung(kata, huruf);
            k := k + 1;
        ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
        hasilExpr := StrKeAngka(kata);
      ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
    j := j + 1;
  ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
  AmbilVar := hasilExpr;
ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;

ꦥꦿꦺꦴꦱꦺꦢꦸꦂ SimpanProc(n : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ; body : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ);
ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
  procSimpan := Gabung(procSimpan, n);
  procSimpan := Gabung(procSimpan, '#');
  procSimpan := Gabung(procSimpan, body);
  procSimpan := Gabung(procSimpan, '@');
ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;

ꦥꦿꦺꦴꦱꦺꦢꦸꦂ SimpanFunc(n : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ; body : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ);
ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
  funcSimpan := Gabung(funcSimpan, n);
  funcSimpan := Gabung(funcSimpan, '#');
  funcSimpan := Gabung(funcSimpan, body);
  funcSimpan := Gabung(funcSimpan, '@');
ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;

ꦥ꦳ꦸꦁꦱꦶ AmbilProc(n : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ) : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
  hasilStr := '';
  j := 1;
  ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ j <= Panjang(procSimpan) ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ
  ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
    cocok := 1;
    k := 1;
    ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ k <= Panjang(n) ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ
    ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
      ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ Ambil(procSimpan, j + k - 1) <> Ambil(n, k) ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
        cocok := 0;
      k := k + 1;
    ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
    ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ cocok = 1 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
      ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ Ambil(procSimpan, j + Panjang(n)) = '#' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
      ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
        kata := '';
        k := j + Panjang(n) + 1;
        ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ k <= Panjang(procSimpan) ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ
        ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
          huruf := Ambil(procSimpan, k);
          ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ huruf = '@' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
            k := Panjang(procSimpan) + 1
          ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
            kata := Gabung(kata, huruf);
            k := k + 1;
        ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
        hasilStr := kata;
      ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
    j := j + 1;
  ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
  AmbilProc := hasilStr;
ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;

ꦥ꦳ꦸꦁꦱꦶ AmbilFunc(n : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ) : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ;
ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
  hasilStr := '';
  j := 1;
  ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ j <= Panjang(funcSimpan) ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ
  ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
    cocok := 1;
    k := 1;
    ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ k <= Panjang(n) ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ
    ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
      ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ Ambil(funcSimpan, j + k - 1) <> Ambil(n, k) ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
        cocok := 0;
      k := k + 1;
    ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
    ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ cocok = 1 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
      ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ Ambil(funcSimpan, j + Panjang(n)) = '#' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
      ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
        kata := '';
        k := j + Panjang(n) + 1;
        ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ k <= Panjang(funcSimpan) ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ
        ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
          huruf := Ambil(funcSimpan, k);
          ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ huruf = '@' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
            k := Panjang(funcSimpan) + 1
          ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
            kata := Gabung(kata, huruf);
            k := k + 1;
        ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
        hasilStr := kata;
      ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
    j := j + 1;
  ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
  AmbilFunc := hasilStr;
ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;

ꦥ꦳ꦸꦁꦱꦶ KeywordKeToken(k : ꦠꦼꦩ꧀ꦧꦸꦁ) : ꦲꦁꦏ;
ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
  ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'ꦩꦸꦭꦶ' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
    KeywordKeToken := 10
  ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
    ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
      KeywordKeToken := 11
    ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
      ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'ꦠꦸꦭꦶꦱ꧀' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
        KeywordKeToken := 20
      ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
        ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'ꦪꦺꦤ꧀' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
          KeywordKeToken := 12
        ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
          ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
            KeywordKeToken := 13
          ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
            ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
              KeywordKeToken := 14
            ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
              ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                KeywordKeToken := 15
              ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                  KeywordKeToken := 16
                ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                  ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'ꦥꦿꦺꦴꦱꦺꦢꦸꦂ' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                    KeywordKeToken := 17
                  ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                    ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'ꦥ꦳ꦸꦁꦱꦶ' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                      KeywordKeToken := 19
                    ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                      ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'ꦏꦁꦒꦺꦴ' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                        KeywordKeToken := 18
                      ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                        ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'ꦠꦸꦩꦼꦏ' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                          KeywordKeToken := 21
                        ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                          ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'begin' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                            KeywordKeToken := 10
                          ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                            ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'end' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                              KeywordKeToken := 11
                            ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                              ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'writeln' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                                KeywordKeToken := 20
                              ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                                ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'if' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                                  KeywordKeToken := 12
                                ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                                  ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'while' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                                    KeywordKeToken := 15
                                  ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                                    ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'for' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                                      KeywordKeToken := 18
                                    ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                                      ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ k = 'function' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                                        KeywordKeToken := 19
                                      ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                                        KeywordKeToken := 99;
ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;

ꦥꦿꦺꦴꦱꦺꦢꦸꦂ NextToken;
ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
  ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ i <= panjang ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ
  ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
    huruf := Ambil(kode, i);
    ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ huruf = ' ' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
      i := i + 1
    ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
      ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ ApaAngka(huruf) = 1 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
        ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
          kata := '';
          ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ i <= panjang ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ
          ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
            huruf := Ambil(kode, i);
            ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ ApaAngka(huruf) = 1 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
            ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
              kata := Gabung(kata, huruf);
              i := i + 1;
            ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ
            ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
              i := panjang + 1;
          ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
          curToken := 30;
          curText := kata;
          i := i + 1;
        ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ
        ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
          ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ ApaHuruf(huruf) = 1 ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
          ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
            kata := '';
            ꦱꦼꦭꦶꦫꦺ i <= panjang ꦭꦏꦺꦴꦤꦶ
            ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
              huruf := Ambil(kode, i);
              ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ ApaHuruf(huruf) = 1 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
              ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
                kata := Gabung(kata, huruf);
                i := i + 1;
              ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ
              ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ ApaAngka(huruf) = 1 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
                  kata := Gabung(kata, huruf);
                  i := i + 1;
                ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ
                ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                  i := panjang + 1;
            ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ;
            curToken := KeywordKeToken(kata);
            curText := kata;
          ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ
          ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
            ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ huruf = ':' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
              ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ Ambil(kode, i + 1) = '=' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
              ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
                curToken := 40;
                curText := ':=';
                i := i + 2;
              ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ
              ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                curToken := 42;
                curText := ':';
                i := i + 1
            ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
              ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ huruf = ';' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                curToken := 41;
                curText := ';';
                i := i + 1
              ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
                ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ huruf = '.' ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
                  curToken := 44;
